{"activity_text": "Anti-Gram-", "article_id": "", "assay_text": "CD", "assay_type": "", "comments_text": "Sequence analysis: APD analysis reveals that this sequence is similar (47.37%) to synthetic AS-18W L: 40%, K: 40%. Activity: Active against E. coli ATCC 25922 (MIC 71.39 ug/ml), S.aureus ATCC 6538 (MIC 287.09 ug/ml), and C.albicans ATCC 10231 (MIC 142.78 uM). Warning: other bacteria not tested. Structure: random coil in HEPES buffer and helical in 30 mM SDS. In vitro toxicity: human RBC: HC50 >265 uM, less hemo.lytic. Animal model:wax moth:survival: no increase in survival of Galleria mellonella 24 hpi or longer.", "concentration": "", "cytotoxicity_text": "", "hemolytic_activity_text": "", "measure_group": "", "measure_value": "", "pubmed_id": "41203585", "record_granularity": "entry_text", "reference_text": "Chem Biol Drug Des. 2025 Nov;106(5):e70193. doi: 10.1111/cbdd.70193. PubMed", "sequence_key": "APD6:AP05971", "source_id": "AP05971", "source_numeric_id": "05971", "source_path": "APD6/apd6_export/structured/peptides.csv", "source_record_id": "AP05971", "source_table": "peptides.csv", "stability_text": "", "subject_name": "", "target_organism_text": "", "title": "Design of Hybrid Bioactive Peptides Derived From Cecropin and Cathepsin for Therapeutic Application.", "unit": "", "﻿database": "APD6"}
{"activity_text": "Anti-Gram-", "article_id": "", "assay_text": "CD", "assay_type": "", "comments_text": "Sequence analysis: APD analysis reveals that this sequence is similar (47.06%) to synthetic Myxinidin2 L: 40%, K: 40%. Activity: Active against E. coli ATCC 25922 (MIC 67.31 ug/ml), S.aureus ATCC 6538 (MIC 269.32 ug/ml), and C.albicans ATCC 10231 (MIC >269.32 uM). Warning: other bacteria not tested. Structure: random coil in HEPES buffer and helical in 30 mM SDS. In vitro toxicity: human RBC: HC50 >265 uM, less hemo.lytic. Cytotoxicity: human umbilical cord vein endothelial cells (HUVEC), TC50 > 265 uM; human melanoma cell line (A375): TC50 > 265 uM. Not toxic.", "concentration": "", "cytotoxicity_text": "", "hemolytic_activity_text": "", "measure_group": "", "measure_value": "", "pubmed_id": "41203585", "record_granularity": "entry_text", "reference_text": "Chem Biol Drug Des. 2025 Nov;106(5):e70193. doi: 10.1111/cbdd.70193. PubMed", "sequence_key": "APD6:AP05972", "source_id": "AP05972", "source_numeric_id": "05972", "source_path": "APD6/apd6_export/structured/peptides.csv", "source_record_id": "AP05972", "source_table": "peptides.csv", "stability_text": "", "subject_name": "", "target_organism_text": "", "title": "Design of Hybrid Bioactive Peptides Derived From Cecropin and Cathepsin for Therapeutic Application.", "unit": "", "﻿database": "APD6"}
